{
  "_comment": [
    "Synthetic dump in the exact shape mcp-server-for-revit 1.0.0 returns for",
    "get_current_view_elements when a 3D view is active. Structure, field names",
    "and the decimal-comma number formatting are verbatim from a real response;",
    "project/type names, ids and coordinates are invented.",
    "",
    "Shape notes this fixture pins:",
    "  * per-element parameters are nested under 'Properties', not top level",
    "  * 'Name' is the TYPE name, and is the join key to the type tier",
    "  * 'Properties.Family' and 'Properties.Type' both hold the numeric type",
    "    ElementId - neither is a readable family name",
    "  * numbers are locale strings ('-202,83'), so float() raises on them",
    "  * point-based elements carry LocationX/Y/Z; line-based carry",
    "    StartX/Y/Z + EndX/Y/Z + Length, and nothing carries a level/storey",
    "",
    "Element 5 deliberately holds a lone comma with three trailing digits",
    "('1,234'), the one separator shape that is genuinely ambiguous."
  ],
